Spec: Global Website Styles

Purpose:
  Provide the responsive visual system and visible interaction states for the website.

Owns:
  ./global.css

Must:
  Layouts remain usable at narrow viewport widths without horizontal page overflow.
  Keyboard focus is visible on interactive controls.
  Motion-sensitive users can request reduced motion.
  Text and controls maintain readable contrast against their backgrounds.

Done when:
  Focus and reduced-motion styles are present and the layout has a narrow-screen breakpoint.
